{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba woof/schemas/gate.schema.json | sed -n '1,260p'\"","aggregated_output":"     1\t{\n     2\t  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n     3\t  \"$id\": \"https://woof.dev/schemas/gate.schema.json\",\n     4\t  \"title\": \"woof gate front-matter\",\n     5\t  \"description\": \"YAML front-matter of .woof/epics/E<N>/gate.md. Validates the structured header only; the prose sections (## Context, ## Findings, ## Position) are unconstrained markdown. The gate.md represents an OPEN gate; resolution is recorded as a jsonl event with a decision drawn from the taxonomy in jsonl-events.schema.json (gate_resolved.decision). triggered_by[] enum values are registry-derived check IDs plus driver-level triggers; the enum is snapshot-tested against the registry in tests/unit/woof/test_check_stage_5_subcommand.py.\",\n     6\t  \"type\": \"object\",\n     7\t  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n     8\t  \"required\": [\"type\", \"stage\", \"story_id\", \"triggered_by\", \"timestamp\"],\n     9\t  \"properties\": {\n    10\t    \"type\": {\n    11\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n    12\t      \"enum\": [\"plan_gate\", \"story_gate\", \"review_gate\"],\n    13\t      \"description\": \"plan_gate (Stage 4, always opens). story_gate (Stage 6, conditional on Stage 5 check failure or executor halt). review_gate (periodic; opens every-N stories or before epic close to surface accumulated minor critique findings).\"\n    14\t    },\n    15\t    \"stage\": {\n    16\t      \"type\": \"integer\",\n    17\t      \"enum\": [4, 5, 6],\n    18\t      \"description\": \"Stage that wrote the gate. plan_gate=4, story_gate=6, review_gate=5 (post-story rollup) or 6 (end-of-epic).\"\n    19\t    },\n    20\t    \"story_id\": {\n    21\t      \"oneOf\": [\n    22\t        { \"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^S[1-9]\\\\d*$\" },\n    23\t        { \"type\": \"null\" }\n    24\t      ],\n    25\t      \"description\": \"Story this gate is for. Required (non-null) when type=story_gate; null for plan_gate. For review_gate, may be null (end-of-epic) or the boundary story (every-N rollup).\"\n    26\t    },\n    27\t    \"triggered_by\": {\n    28\t      \"type\": \"array\",\n    29\t      \"minItems\": 1,\n    30\t      \"uniqueItems\": true,\n    31\t      \"items\": {\n    32\t        \"type\": \"string\",\n    33\t        \"enum\": [\n    34\t          \"plan_review\",\n    35\t          \"check_1_quality_gates\",\n    36\t          \"check_2_outcome_markers\",\n    37\t          \"check_3_scope\",\n    38\t          \"check_4_contract_refs\",\n    39\t          \"check_5_plan_crossrefs\",\n    40\t          \"check_6_critique_blocker\",\n    41\t          \"check_7_commit_transaction\",\n    42\t          \"check_8_docs_drift\",\n    43\t          \"check_9_review_valve\",\n    44\t          \"empty_diff_review\",\n    45\t          \"timeout\",\n    46\t          \"subprocess_crash\",\n    47\t          \"subprocess_aborted\",\n    48\t          \"executor_aborted\",\n    49\t          \"codex_unreachable\",\n    50\t          \"incomplete_subprocess\",\n    51\t          \"schema_validation_failed\",\n    52\t          \"github_sync_conflict\",\n    53\t          \"manual\"\n    54\t        ]\n    55\t      },\n    56\t      \"description\": \"Reasons the gate opened. plan_review fires automatically at Stage 4. check_1_quality_gates..check_9_review_valve map to Stage-5 registry check IDs (canonical names; these replace the legacy check_1_quality_gate etc.). empty_diff_review opens when a story finishes with no diff. Driver-level: subprocess_crash (executor process exited non-zero), subprocess_aborted (SIGTERM/timeout), executor_aborted (executor wrote outcome=aborted_with_position). schema_validation_failed when Stage 3 self-validation exhausts the 2-attempt cap. github_sync_conflict when push detects remote-issue changes. manual for human-opened gates.\"\n    57\t    },\n    58\t    \"timestamp\": {\n    59\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n    60\t      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    61\t    },\n    62\t    \"exit_code\": {\n    63\t      \"type\": \"integer\",\n    64\t      \"description\": \"Subprocess exit code. Required when triggered_by contains subprocess_crash.\"\n    65\t    },\n    66\t    \"harness_session_id\": {\n    67\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n    68\t      \"minLength\": 1,\n    69\t      \"description\": \"CC session UUID or Codex audit-file path of the subprocess that caused the gate.\"\n    70\t    }\n    71\t  },\n    72\t  \"allOf\": [\n    73\t    {\n    74\t      \"if\": {\n    75\t        \"properties\": { \"type\": { \"const\": \"plan_gate\" } },\n    76\t        \"required\": [\"type\"]\n    77\t      },\n    78\t      \"then\": {\n    79\t        \"properties\": {\n    80\t          \"stage\": { \"const\": 4 },\n    81\t          \"story_id\": { \"type\": \"null\" }\n    82\t        }\n    83\t      }\n    84\t    },\n    85\t    {\n    86\t      \"if\": {\n    87\t        \"properties\": { \"type\": { \"const\": \"story_gate\" } },\n    88\t        \"required\": [\"type\"]\n    89\t      },\n    90\t      \"then\": {\n    91\t        \"properties\": {\n    92\t          \"stage\": { \"const\": 6 },\n    93\t          \"story_id\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^S[1-9]\\\\d*$\" }\n    94\t        }\n    95\t      }\n    96\t    },\n    97\t    {\n    98\t      \"if\": {\n    99\t        \"properties\": {\n   100\t          \"triggered_by\": {\n   101\t            \"type\": \"array\",\n   102\t            \"contains\": { \"const\": \"subprocess_crash\" }\n   103\t          }\n   104\t        },\n   105\t        \"required\": [\"triggered_by\"]\n   106\t      },\n   107\t      \"then\": {\n   108\t        \"required\": [\"exit_code\"]\n   109\t      }\n   110\t    }\n   111\t  ]\n   112\t}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
