 as a Stage-5 implementation note for S1 (CD4 already in scope); bootstrap-order constraint met (S1 lands check_6 + driver-owned commit).\"}\n    11\t{\"event\":\"story_completed\",\"at\":\"2026-04-29T13:25:59Z\",\"epic_id\":182,\"story_id\":\"S1\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
